    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d436">

                <pb facs="0490" n="1168" sameAs="frus:frus1863p2/pg1168"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Sanford</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 104.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-06-30"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 30, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: * * * * * * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I take this occasion, also, to acknowledge the receipt of your despatch No. 124,
                    of the 12th instant, and to approve your proceedings with reference to the
                    proposed conference on the subject of the capitalization of the Scheldt dues, to
                    be held on the 1st proximo.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Henry S. Sanford</hi>, Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c., Brussels.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
